# MapLibre's worker and shared chunk are copied out of node_modules into
# public/ by scripts/copy-maplibre-worker.mjs, which runs on prebuild and
# predev. They are build output, not source: committing them would duplicate
# node_modules in the repository and let the copy drift from the installed
# maplibre-gl version. Vercel regenerates them during its own build.
/public/maplibre/

# Downloaded public-source workbooks are reproducible from the source registry
# and can be large.  Reports and importers are committed; raw downloads are not.
/.cache/public-atlas/

# Output from the /founder: skills in .claude/skills/founder/. They write a
# founder/ directory at the repository root and read each other's files from
# it, so it accumulates whatever the skills are told about StrayPaw's stage,
# metrics, team and any raise. That is working material, and some of it is
# not ours to publish, so it stays local.
#
# Rooted on purpose: a bare "founder/" would also match the skill pack at
# .claude/skills/founder/ and the sample output inside its examples, which
# are committed and must stay that way.
/founder/
